om/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1182381367083581_8403279582652785227_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vGKtPtXlZHIQ7kNvwEdZkeu&_nc_oc=AdkjEGoo1EpdvJbZg0u7aqOjagpUAPM2vPBRaq6ojivxm3O3XANApfFM6BUoA8mpIA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsplyeDZVFvYfvi5EnSn2jqtQ_Is-KSiduV660xPGJA2w&oe=69A2F3ED"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_xS8j-sVIcQQ7kNvwHkS2Xq&_nc_oc=Adk5CGoE3116IfzTkWraizKHcyYLVWTWthXkNLZAAyIUQbH0vk0ZPLlQ8UZZHrxOgMQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuJv07_VRlWGOF_YO_zWQ8oMWz7v_NS3MRdcAyNemXVfw&oe=69A2F437"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_fDt2kNJvKEQ7kNvwF8f5k_&_nc_oc=AdnaQwsRtym7o-XEVSvgGDHBAqZhKCoe3xYFgmfaWvyRFy8eEy71LmvgRNNtD6dN6NE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv6D5Eby-0u3UQ7UuKwdel55fAXjIZsBEg4QAzj08bGXQ&oe=69A2CC2C"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nth